{"availability":"available","full":"xiaotonng/pikiloom","name":"pikiloom","description":"Put the world's smartest AI agents & plugins in your pocket","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":295,"forks":30,"created":"2026-03-06T16:15:17Z","updated":"2026-10-12T15:44:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://xiaotonng.github.io/pikiloom/","topics":["ai","claude","cli","codex","coding","nodejs","npx","telegram"],"demo":"https://xiaotonng.github.io/pikiloom/#in-action","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:55.810Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:55.810Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:55.810Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:13.822Z","stars":295,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:21.579Z","stars":295,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:46.623Z","stars":295,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:40.926Z","stars":295,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:23:24.046Z","stars":294,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:32:55.810Z","stars":295,"forks":30}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:01.154Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Put the world's smartest AI agents in your pocket.","Most \"AI dev tools\" settle for a narrow slice of the pie—binding you to a single IDE, a specific agent, or a closed model ecosystem. pikiloom is built on a fundamentally different premise: the next era of software creation won't be confined to a single code editor. It happens within an Orchestrator that empowers a creator to drive a swarm of agents—in parallel, from one console—running on the best models available, through whichever terminal is closest at hand. And you might never need to open a code file.","The product is the orchestrator itself. Everything else simply plugs in. And what's cooler is that this orchestrator is entirely self-bootstrapped—pikiloom is what we use to build pikiloom."],"features":["Entry Points — Telegram, Feishu, WeChat, Slack, Discord, DingTalk, WeCom, the Web Dashboard, and the local API/CLI are all first-class, co-equal terminals. New ones plug right in.","Pluggable Agents — Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, and Hermes ship as built-in drivers. Hermes speaks ACP (Agent Client Protocol); the registry accepts any CLI- or ACP-based agent through the same AgentDriver contract.","Model Routing — Frontier (Claude · GPT · Gemini), Chinese domestic (DeepSeek · Doubao · MiMo · MiniMax · Qwen), local runtimes (Ollama, mlx-lm on Apple Silicon), OpenRouter, and any OpenAI-compatible proxy. Providers +…","Tool Mesh — Skills, MCP servers, CLI tools, web search, and desktop automation, intelligently merged across global × workspace scopes and silently injected into every session."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xiaotonng/pikiloom/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4f3a16b2952e21384bb52ff4ba50623b9a9b9d8fff6ad3a39f076dea2da0ac0e","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:14:59.895Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T14:34:18.420Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T15:44:50Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Put the world's smartest AI agents in your pocket.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xiaotonng/pikiloom/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"OAuth-web login handoffs route through the agent's normal tool surface.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xiaotonng/pikiloom/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in to your tools once and reuse those authenticated sessions across every future task.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xiaotonng/pikiloom/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4f3a16b2952e21384bb52ff4ba50623b9a9b9d8fff6ad3a39f076dea2da0ac0e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xiaotonng/pikiloom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T14:34:18.420Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xiaotonng/pikiloom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T14:34:18.422Z","hash":"4f3a16b